    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your soldiers to break through the enemy lines and bring critical intelligence back to your homeland!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic strategy tactics game where you will lead your soldiers through a series of strategic battles, engaging in life-or-death struggles with the enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Skill System</strong>: Each class and character has unique skills, greatly enhancing the depth of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Promotion System</strong>: Every unit type has two possible promotion paths to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Relic System</strong>: Equip specific relics to unlock new hidden classes, offering an unprecedented experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Enhancement System</strong>: A unique system of military achievements and honors that allows you to freely allocate attributes and skill upgrades for each unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Weather System</strong>: A variety of weather conditions that add richness to tactical planning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your soldiers to break through the enemy lines and bring critical intelligence back to your homeland!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic strategy tactics game where you will lead your soldiers through a series of strategic battles, engaging in life-or-death struggles with the enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Skill System</strong>: Each class and character has unique skills, greatly enhancing the depth of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Promotion System</strong>: Every unit type has two possible promotion paths to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Relic System</strong>: Equip specific relics to unlock new hidden classes, offering an unprecedented experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Enhancement System</strong>: A unique system of military achievements and honors that allows you to freely allocate attributes and skill upgrades for each unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Weather System</strong>: A variety of weather conditions that add richness to tactical planning.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a classic strategy tactics game where you will play as a young general of the kingdom, leading the remaining soldiers to break through enemy lines and bring back critical intelligence to your homeland.",
